symbol minimap_input
lines 0 35
hash fb9241cc481f8b5d
note The handler, run each graph phase right after the wheel: while the minimap element is held down (last frame's rectangle and last frame's Minimap, the pair the reader saw), the pressed point is turned into a world point and the camera is panned so it sits at the canvas centre. The first frame of a press records the drag: the offset from the camera rectangle's centre when the press is inside it, none otherwise, and the world at that moment. Releasing, or the minimap disappearing, drops the drag.

